      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate doctors and skilled groomers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients express deep gratitude to Dr Almeida, Dr Osadiaye, Dr Strother, and groomers Tori, Vickie, and Lisa for their attentive care. Reviewers highlight decades of consistent service, noting that clinicians explain complex conditions clearly and handle emergencies with empathy. Several pet owners praise the team for accommodating personal needs and scheduling changes."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 21,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive handling for cats and dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents appreciate how comfortable their animals feel during grooming sessions, wellness exams, and chronic care visits. Reviews note that staff handle large cats, senior dogs, and pets with complex medical needs gently and without stress. Owners feel confident entrusting elderly pets and rescue animals to the experienced veterinary team."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective treatments and thorough grooming"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report positive medical outcomes for acute infections, dental concerns, and senior pet management plans. Clients also commend the grooming team for meticulous styling, noting that pets return home clean, neat, and smelling wonderful. Pet owners value the hospital as a reliable medical provider for long-term veterinary needs."
      }
    }
  ],
